@* Hero call to action: a real drop zone in a moving caution-tape frame. A file dropped here is weighed by the price calculator further down the page. *@
<div class="tt-herodrop-wrap" data-tt-reveal style="--d:.3s">
    <label class="tt-herodrop" data-tt-herodrop>
        <input type="file" accept=".stl,.obj,.3mf" multiple aria-label="Chọn file 3D để báo giá" />
        <span class="tt-herodrop-badge">Mới · miễn phí</span>
        <span class="tt-herodrop-icon">@StudioIcons.Get("upload")</span>
        <span class="tt-herodrop-text">
            <b>Thả file 3D — biết giá trong 5 giây</b>
            <small>STL · OBJ · 3MF · tự đo kích thước, xem mô hình 3D, tính số gram</small>
        </span>
        <span class="tt-herodrop-go">Chọn file →</span>
    </label>
</div>
